{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":14.4},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":15.6,"end":29.6},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":31.44,"end":42.16}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":3.76,"text":"理想彈性碰撞同時守恆動量與動能。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":4.36,"end":5.84,"text":"在一維中，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":5.92,"end":7.92,"text":"相同質量會交換速度。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":8.4,"end":11.6,"text":"這讓我們能以可預測的方式推出目標，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":11.88,"end":14.4,"text":"不需要偷偷加入看不見的推力。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":15.6,"end":16.8,"text":"讓物體二靜止，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":17.04,"end":19.44,"text":"物體一以速度 4 前進，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":20,"end":22.72,"text":"兩者質量相同且恢復係數為 1。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":23.52,"end":25.68,"text":"檢查碰撞後的兩個速度。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":26.88,"end":28.16,"text":"這次彈性碰撞後，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":28.24,"end":29.6,"text":"物體一會怎樣？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":31.44,"end":32.72,"text":"這次彈性碰撞後，"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":32.8,"end":34.16,"text":"物體一會怎樣？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":35.52,"end":39.12,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":39.76,"end":42.16,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}